  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">China-Africa-UNIDO CoE Talent Development Component- SME Competitiveness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the framework of the China- Ethiopia-UNIDO Center of Excellence initiative and more specifically under the Talent Development Pillar, UNIDO is currently developing a new project to promote competitiveness of Ethiopian SMEs and to improve the national SME support ecosystem. The Ministry of Industry has confirmed its interest in implementing a project with this scope. A PA phase will be implemented to finalize the project document.</narrative>
  </description>
